{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早安吻”也渐渐变得激烈起来。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾、啾、嗯呼、啾、啾……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「啾、啾、嗯呼、啾、啾……」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2496", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～安洁……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少、爷……啊唔、呼、啾、嗯唔。啾……嗯……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「少、爷……啊唔、呼、啾、嗯唔。啾……嗯……」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2497", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱着安洁，她的舌头伸进来，与我的交缠，相互吮吸。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "我抱着安洁，她的舌头伸进来，与我的交缠，相互吮吸。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然没有睁开眼，但我也知道，她的脸一定变得通红了。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "虽然没有睁开眼，但我也知道，她的脸一定变得通红了。", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天，感觉她特别的……", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……啊」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2498", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿，早上好，少爷」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2499", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上好……啊？安洁」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早，今天的安洁也是超～喜欢少爷哦」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「早，今天的安洁也是超～喜欢少爷哦」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2500", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～真是失礼了～哎嘿、哎嘿嘿、少爷少爷～」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「哎呀～真是失礼了～哎嘿、哎嘿嘿、少爷少爷～」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2501", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，嗯，我也是，最喜欢安洁了」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且还说出口了。啊啊安洁一大早就要升天了……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「而且还说出口了。啊啊安洁一大早就要升天了……」", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2502", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在你升天之前我先问一件事」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁最喜欢的是少爷的睡颜哦……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "「安洁最喜欢的是少爷的睡颜哦……」", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2503", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天好像比平时要早吧？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2504", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正是这样，亲亲的时间比平时增加了三成呢」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "「正是这样，亲亲的时间比平时增加了三成呢」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2505", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常抱歉少爷！是比平时要早的！」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「非常抱歉少爷！是比平时要早的！」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2506", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是……」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2507", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再来两成」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯唔……？！啾、嗯、嗯唔」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2508", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哈，哈唔、啾啾、少爷……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2509", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉真的快要升天了……今天少爷的亲亲，真是百分百的感觉……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「感觉真的快要升天了……今天少爷的亲亲，真是百分百的感觉……」", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2510", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉，不知不觉上头了」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样一来，出门的时间也比平时早了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺便一说，樱乃说要“再睡十分钟”，就回房间了。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "顺便一说，樱乃说要“再睡十分钟”，就回房间了。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她要是真能十分钟就起来就好了。冬天的回笼觉可是很危险的啊，我的妹妹……", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "她要是真能十分钟就起来就好了。冬天的回笼觉可是很危险的啊，我的妹妹……", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说……安洁」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2511", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，抱歉让少爷陪着我了」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "「总之，抱歉让少爷陪着我了」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2512", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让你一个人先出门，我才是真的抱歉呢」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「让你一个人先出门，我才是真的抱歉呢」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「丢下少爷一个人的话，安洁真是罪该万死」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「丢下少爷一个人的话，安洁真是罪该万死」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2513", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以才让您早起了。啊啊、爱也是一种罪过呢……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「所以才让您早起了。啊啊、爱也是一种罪过呢……」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2514", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟今早收到了百分百的亲亲，所以陪你多久我都愿意」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「毕竟今早收到了百分百的亲亲，所以陪你多久我都愿意」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，为什么今天一定要提早来学校呢？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是的，安洁今早提前把我叫醒，一定有什么理由。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "是的，安洁今早提前把我叫醒，一定有什么理由。", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，其实……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2515", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁羞得满脸通红。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她磨磨蹭蹭地碰了碰手指，说道——", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "她磨磨蹭蹭地碰了碰手指，说道——", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「实际上，我想站在校门口，迎接同学们进校」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "「实际上，我想站在校门口，迎接同学们进校」", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2516", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
