{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是安洁，你不可能“这样就行了”吧？」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": "「但是安洁，你不可能“这样就行了”吧？」", "plain_idx": 443, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……您已经知道了吗？」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2535", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「差不多吧，我毕竟是你的少爷呢」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不如说，我的直觉告诉我，早上的问候不过是开始，对安洁来说“感谢还不到位”。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": "不如说，我的直觉告诉我，早上的问候不过是开始，对安洁来说“感谢还不到位”。", "plain_idx": 447, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我来说也一样。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……毕竟我们如此快乐。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也要让大家感到快乐啊」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2536", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说，行动还会继续吗」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0375", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那接下来打算怎么做？」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0376", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「按正常流程来说，应该是“一路走好”，对吧？」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": "「按正常流程来说，应该是“一路走好”，对吧？」", "plain_idx": 457, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1013", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那也不错，但是……」", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2537", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……该怎么说呢，既然要办，我想要做一些“决定性的”的事情」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": "「但是……该怎么说呢，既然要办，我想要做一些“决定性的”的事情」", "plain_idx": 461, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2538", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真不愧是喜欢活动的安洁说的话。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来如此，这样的话……」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～照着以前的活动办的话，又有种在做学校工作的感觉，也不太对呢」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": "「嗯～照着以前的活动办的话，又有种在做学校工作的感觉，也不太对呢」", "plain_idx": 465, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样就麻烦了」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4110", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……好不容易有点头绪，这样又回到原点了」", "text_idx": 468, "plain": "「啊……好不容易有点头绪，这样又回到原点了」", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在安洁的角色更多是通过我来与学校互动。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": "现在安洁的角色更多是通过我来与学校互动。", "plain_idx": 469, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，现在并没有特别的事。其实我正在尽量不给安洁分配工作」", "text_idx": 470, "plain": "「所以，现在并没有特别的事。其实我正在尽量不给安洁分配工作」", "plain_idx": 470, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
